{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50704","headline":"到广陵 · 张祜","name":"到广陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一年江海恣狂游，夜宿倡家晓上楼。\n嗜酒几曾羣从小，爲文多是讽诸侯。\n逢人说劒三攘臂，对镜吟诗一掉头。\n今日更来憔悴意，不堪风月满扬州。\n（此以下均见南宋蜀刻本《张承吉文集》卷七。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50704.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50704","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}